Line 3: I can only take a character from text, but this is a list of numbers.
    say character 1 of scores
                       ^^^^^^
To take an item of a list, write it with "item", like "item 1 of scores".

Line 4: I can only take characters from text, but this is a number.
    say characters 1 to 2 of 42
                             ^^

Line 5: I can only take an item from a list, but this is text.
    say item 1 of word
                  ^^^^
To take a character of text, write it with "character", like "character 1 of word".

Line 6: I can only take items from a list, but this is text.
    say items 1 to 2 of word
                        ^^^^
To take characters of text, write it with "characters", like "characters 2 to 4 of word".

Line 7: I can only look for something in text or a list, but this is a number.
    say 42 contains "4"
        ^^

Line 8: I can only look for text in text, but this is a number.
    say word contains 4
                      ^
Turn it into text first with "as text".

Line 9: I can only look for text in text, but this is a number.
    say the position of 4 in word
                        ^
Turn it into text first with "as text".

Line 10: "scores" is a list of numbers, so it can't contain text.
    say scores contains "x"
                        ^^^
A list holds one kind of value. To keep text too, make a separate list for it.

Line 11: "starts with" needs text on both sides, but this is a number.
    say 42 starts with "4"
        ^^

Line 12: "ends with" needs text on both sides, but this is a number.
    say word ends with 4
                       ^

Line 13: I can only take the characters of text, but this is a number.
    say the characters of 42
                          ^^

Line 14: I can only take the words of text, but this is a number.
    say the words of 42
                     ^^

Line 15: I can only take the lines of text, but this is a yes/no value.
    say the lines of yes
                     ^^^

Line 16: I can only put text in uppercase, but this is a number.
    say 42 in uppercase
        ^^

Line 17: I can only put text in lowercase, but this is a number.
    say 42 in lowercase
        ^^

Line 18: I can only take extra spaces off text, but this is a number.
    say 42 without extra spaces
        ^^

Line 19: I can only split text, but this is a number.
    say 42 split by ","
        ^^

Line 20: Text can only be split by text, but this is a number.
    say word split by 4
                      ^

Line 21: I can only join the items of a list, but this is text.
    say word joined with ", "
        ^^^^

Line 22: I can only join numbers, text or yes/no values, but this is a list of lists of numbers.
    say (a list of (a list of 1)) joined with ", "
        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

Line 23: The items can only be joined with text, but this is a number.
    say scores joined with 4
                           ^

Line 24: I can only replace things in text, but this is a number.
    say 42 with "4" replaced by "5"
        ^^

Line 25: I can only replace text with text, but this is a number.
    say word with 4 replaced by "5"
                  ^

Line 26: I can only replace text with text, but this is a number.
    say word with "a" replaced by 5
                                  ^

Line 27: I can only find the code of a character, but this is a number.
    say the code of 65
                    ^^

Line 28: A character code has to be a number, but this is text.
    say the character with code "A"
                                ^^^

Line 29: I can only check whether text is a letter, but this is a number.
    say 5 is a letter
        ^

Line 30: I can only check whether text is a digit, but this is a number.
    say 5 is a digit
        ^

Line 31: I can only check whether text is a space, but this is a number.
    say 5 is not a space
        ^

Line 32: The position of a character has to be a number, but this is text.
    say character "x" of word
                  ^^^

Line 33: The number of characters has to be a number, but this is text.
    say the first "x" characters of word
                  ^^^
